--- !u!114 &1384020007
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1384020005}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Battle Brothers, the mission entrusted to you is one of great honor and
    sacrifice. In the abyss of the Warp, in the most remote corner of the galaxy,
    rests the Emperor''s Sword, an artifact of immeasurable power, a symbol of the
    Emperor''s divine will over us all.


    Today, that power is in peril. The
    Orks, primitive and savage creatures, have sensed its call and, like rabid beasts,
    march toward it with a single objective: to destroy it or, worse, seize its power.
    Their hordes are countless, and their fury, unrelenting.


    You, Ultramarine
    brothers, are the last guardians of its light in this dark place. There is no
    retreat. The only option is victory, for failure is not an option when defending
    what is most sacred. Your mission is simple: defend the Emperor''s Sword at all
    costs. Let the glory of Ultramar shine through your deeds.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
